        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9ld",
          "text": "That jolt, the sudden stop, the confusion… it’s a feeling nobody forgets. If you’ve just been in a car accident that wasn’t your fault, I know your head is probably spinning. And one of the first things you’re probably asking yourself is, ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9lf",
          "text": "should I get a lawyer for a car accident that wasn’t my fault?",
          "marks": [
            "l9le",
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9lg",
          "text": " Honestly, it’s a smart question. At ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9lh",
          "text": "Dormer Harpring",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9li",
          "text": ", we’ve seen firsthand how overwhelming this can be. You’re not just a case file to us. You’re someone who needs help. Let’s talk about the steps you need to take ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9lj",
          "text": "right now",
          "marks": [
            "em"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9lk",
          "text": " to start putting the pieces back together.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9ln",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9lm",
          "text": "What to Do After a Car Accident That Wasn’t Your Fault",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9lp",
      "style": "h3",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9lo",
          "text": "Check for Injuries",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9lr",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9lq",
          "text": "Your health and safety come first. Call 911 immediately if you or anyone else is injured. Even if you feel fine, some injuries may not show symptoms right away. Documenting your condition early can strengthen your case and ensure you get the medical care you need.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9lt",
      "style": "h3",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9ls",
          "text": "Move to a Safe Location",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9lv",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9lu",
          "text": "If your vehicle is causing a hazard, move it to a safe area if it’s possible and safe to do so. Turn on your hazard lights and use cones or flares if available to alert other drivers. Staying in an unsafe position on the road can increase the risk of further collisions.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9lx",
      "style": "h3",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9lw",
          "text": "Gather Evidence",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9lz",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9ly",
          "text": "Take clear photos of vehicle damage, road conditions, traffic signals, and any visible injuries. If possible, record a video of the scene and any contributing factors, such as weather conditions or skid marks. The more evidence you collect, the stronger your case will be when dealing with insurance companies.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9m1",
      "style": "h3",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9m0",
          "text": "Exchange Information",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9m3",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9m2",
          "text": "Collect the other driver’s full name, contact information, insurance provider, policy number, driver’s license number, and vehicle registration details. Also, get contact details from any witnesses who saw the accident. Their statements can provide valuable support if the fault is disputed.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9m5",
      "style": "h3",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9m4",
          "text": "Be Careful With Your Words",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9m7",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9m6",
          "text": "Avoid making statements that could be interpreted as accepting blame, even if you feel sympathetic toward the other driver. A simple “I’m sorry” can be misused by insurance companies as an admission of fault. Stick to the facts and let your attorney handle the discussions when necessary.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9m9",
      "style": "h3",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9m8",
          "text": "File a Police Report",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9mf",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "l9mb",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://co.colorado.gov/file-online-crash-report"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9ma",
          "text": "In Colorado, accidents must be reported if they involve injuries, fatalities, or property damage exceeding $1,000 (CRS § 42-4-1606). If law enforcement does not respond, you must file a report online or with local authorities. You can file a report online through the",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9mc",
          "text": " Colorado crash report portal",
          "marks": [
            "l9mb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9me",
          "text": ".",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9mh",
      "style": "h3",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9mg",
          "text": "Seek Medical Attention",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9mj",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9mi",
          "text": "Even if you don’t feel injured, it’s essential to see a doctor. Some injuries, like whiplash or internal damage, may not appear immediately. Getting medical care early ensures that your injuries are documented, which is crucial for any insurance claim or legal case.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9ml",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9mk",
          "text": "Understanding Car Insurance After a No-Fault Accident",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9mn",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9mm",
          "text": "Colorado follows a “fault-based” insurance system, meaning the at-fault driver’s insurance is typically responsible for covering damages. These damages can include medical bills, vehicle repairs, lost wages, and even pain and suffering.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9ms",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9mo",
          "text": "If the at-fault driver is uninsured or underinsured, your uninsured/underinsured motorist policy may help cover the costs. Unfortunately, not all drivers comply with Colorado’s mandatory insurance laws, making it even more important to understand your coverage options.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9mx",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "l9mu",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "/denver-car-accident-lawyer/"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9mt",
          "text": "Dealing with insurance companies can be challenging. Adjusters may try to shift blame or minimize payouts. A ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9mv",
          "text": "Denver car accident lawyer",
          "marks": [
            "l9mu"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9mw",
          "text": " can help ensure that you receive fair compensation and aren’t pressured into accepting a low settlement.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9mz",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9my",
          "text": "Why You Should Let a Lawyer Review Your Case",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9n2",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9n0",
          "text": "Hiring a lawyer may improve your chances of securing full compensation.",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9n1",
          "text": " An experienced attorney can:",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9n4",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9n3",
          "text": "Assess the true value of your claim, including long-term medical expenses",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9n6",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9n5",
          "text": "Gather and analyze crucial evidence, such as traffic camera footage and accident reconstructions",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9n8",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9n7",
          "text": "Handle all communication with insurance adjusters to protect your best interests",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9na",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9n9",
          "text": "Represent you in court if a fair settlement cannot be reached",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9ne",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9nb",
          "text": "Many accident victims underestimate how much their injuries will cost in the long run. Future medical treatments, rehabilitation, lost wages, and emotional distress all contribute to the financial impact. At ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9nc",
          "text": "Dormer Harpring,",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9nd",
          "text": " we offer free case evaluations to help you understand your rights and legal options.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9ng",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9nf",
          "text": "The Role of a Police Report in Determining Fault",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9ni",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9nh",
          "text": "A police report provides an objective record of the accident, often detailing:",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9nk",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9nj",
          "text": "Statements from drivers and witnesses",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9nm",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9nl",
          "text": "Road and weather conditions at the time of the crash",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9no",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9nn",
          "text": "Any observed violations of traffic laws",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9nq",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9np",
          "text": "A summary of how the accident occurred",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9ny",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "l9nu",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://co.colorado.gov/file-online-crash-report"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9nr",
          "text": "While a police report does not legally determine fault, ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9ns",
          "text": "insurance companies and courts often rely on these reports when assessing claims.",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9nt",
          "text": " A strong police report can provide critical support for your case. If you need to file a report, you can do so through the",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9nv",
          "text": " Colorado crash report portal",
          "marks": [
            "l9nu"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9nx",
          "text": ".",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9o0",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9nz",
          "text": "Why Hiring a Lawyer May Benefit You After a No-Fault Car Accident",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9o3",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9o1",
          "text": "A lawyer can be a powerful ally when dealing with insurance companies.",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9o2",
          "text": " Even when you’re not at fault, insurers may try to minimize their payouts. An attorney can:",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9o5",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9o4",
          "text": "Negotiate directly with insurers to maximize your settlement",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9o7",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9o6",
          "text": "Secure expert testimony and accident reconstruction reports to support your case",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9o9",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9o8",
          "text": "Ensure you meet all legal deadlines. In Colorado, you have three years from the date of the accident to file a personal injury lawsuit (CRS § 13-80-101). Failing to act within this period may result in losing your right to compensation.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9ob",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9oa",
          "text": "Challenge unfair fault determinations made by insurers or opposing legal teams",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9od",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9oc",
          "text": "Legal representation is especially beneficial in complex cases, such as accidents involving multiple vehicles, commercial trucks, or severe injuries. At Dormer Harpring, we have extensive experience fighting for accident victims and ensuring they receive fair compensation.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
